FervorField_SafariOffice_ARHU_Text_Scientist1::
	.string "Our research shows every POKéMON\n"
	.string "in the SAFARI ZONE is a rare find.\p"
	.string "They're all partner material.\n"
	.string "Choose the one you bond with.$"

FervorField_SafariOffice_ARHU_Text_Scientist2::
	.string "Remember the type chart.\p"
	.string "GRASS beats WATER, WATER beats\n"
	.string "FIRE, and FIRE beats GRASS.\p"
	.string "Pick a partner, then plan around\n"
	.string "what it's weak to.$"

FervorField_SafariOffice_ARHU_Text_Camper::
	.string "I camped out in the SAFARI ZONE\n"
	.string "for three days!\p"
	.string "The tough ones hide way in the\n"
	.string "back. You'll have to go deep to\l"
	.string "find them!$"

FervorField_SafariOffice_ARHU_Text_Picnicker::
	.string "The cute ones are to the west,\n"
	.string "and the cool ones are to the east.\p"
	.string "I can't decide!$"
